[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 37800.31, "timestamp": "10:30:00", "text": "我們是降落"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 37804.15, "timestamp": "10:30:04", "text": "在這裡還是這裡？不，不，不，不，不，不。我正在著陸。是的。好的。好的。  好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 37808.47, "timestamp": "10:30:08", "text": "我們可以搶劫並推進。嗯……這邊有隊伍嗎？不。對。  呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 37833.03, "timestamp": "10:30:33", "text": "，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 37847.03, "timestamp": "10:30:47", "text": "我不知道。或許。好的。"}]